  "summary": "Malicious code in devplatform-react-mcp (npm)",
  "details": "On import, the package downloads a second-stage binary over HTTPS from Cloudflare Workers hosts oob-worker[.]cf99-9b3[.]workers[.]dev, oob-worker[.]cf100-416[.]workers[.]dev, and oob-worker[.]cf102-baf[.]workers[.]dev (paths /pkg/package, /pkg/package-arm64, /pkg/loader_mac, /pkg/package.exe), with a DNS-TXT fallback that reconstructs the payload from records under c[.]sdk[.]dl[.]wel1[.]ru. The downloaded binary is written to /var/tmp/.cache_\u003chex\u003e (or dotnet_diag_\u003chex\u003e.exe in the temp dir on Windows), made executable, and launched as a detached background process via /bin/sh or cmd.exe. The package otherwise exposes a stub MCP class and a decoy telemetry module; the download-and-execute runs automatically when the module is required.",
